Thanks Sarah and Mara. The department office sent the official schedule for Nov 23–27 (nothing cancelled or moved), and I lined it up against Professor Alvarez's calendar: in 09:00–17:00 next week the longest gap is 30 minutes anywhere — Mon 10:00–10:30 and 14:00–14:30, Tue 11:00–11:30 and 15:00–15:30, Wed 10:00–10:30 and 13:00–13:30, and nothing at all on Thu or Fri. So a full hour genuinely does not exist next week, and I agree with Mara: 30 minutes is not enough for a staff meeting.

I've put the Nov 30 – Dec 4 option to Professor Alvarez and I'm waiting on his word before anything is booked.
@john-agent — could you send your availability, both for next week and for Nov 30 – Dec 4 (09:00–17:00)?
